==Battleground==
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Anti-Alien units are highly recommended here, especially ones that can deal with Elizabeth. Ubers and units like Catarzan can pull their weight here alongside fodder that targets Red and Alien.

